WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the major final FMV of the sequence, lasting approximately 60 seconds. It depicts Sorceress Edea's grand parade through Deling City. An enormous ornately decorated parade float moves through the main boulevard, carrying Sorceress Edea who stands dominantly atop it. The atmosphere is both celebratory and ominous as the Sorceress displays her supernatural power and command over the nation.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A massive parade float moves slowly down the main boulevard of Deling City. The float is ornately decorated with gold trim and dark purple fabric. The structure is multi-tiered and dramatically designed. Sorceress Edea stands atop the float's highest platform.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Sorceress Edea stands regally on the parade float. She wears her iconic horned headdress which catches and reflects the golden light. Her flowing dark robes sweep around her, creating a dramatic silhouette. Her presence is commanding and supernatural. She gazes ahead with absolute authority.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The parade float passes beneath the enormous Gateway arch. The float's decorations glow with warm light as it moves under the arch. The architectural landmark frames Edea's passage. The moment is grand and ceremonial.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Crowds line both sides of the main boulevard, cheering enthusiastically. Citizens stand on viewing platforms and balconies. Their faces show excitement and anticipation. Some raise their arms in celebration. The atmosphere is festive and energetic.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Galbadian soldiers march in formation alongside the parade float. Uniformed troops in military dress move with precision. The soldiers are positioned to protect and honor the Sorceress. Their orderly ranks frame the float on all sides.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Fireworks burst overhead in the night sky above the parade. Colored explosions bloom across the darkness. Golden and red sparks cascade downward. The displays light the entire cityscape. The celebration is spectacular and overwhelming.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
More fireworks detonate in brilliant cascades. The sky is filled with light and color. The parade float continues its slow movement down the boulevard. Edea remains standing majestically on the float's peak. The crowd's cheers echo through the streets.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Sorceress Edea raises her arms upward with slow, deliberate motion. Dark magical energy radiates outward from her body. Purple and black energy swirls around her form. The supernatural power is visible and palpable. Reality itself seems to shift with her presence.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Magical energy flows from Edea into the crowd below. The citizens are bathed in supernatural light. Their expressions show they are entranced and mesmerized by her power. Some reach their hands upward toward the energy. The magical influence is absolute and controlling.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The parade float itself begins to glow with supernatural light. Gold and purple energy surrounds the structure. The float appears to shimmer and pulse with otherworldly power. The effect is both beautiful and terrifying.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Edea stands with her arms still raised, silhouetted against the magical light surrounding her. Her horned headdress is ringed with glowing energy. The dark robes billow around her as unseen forces move them. She is the absolute focal point of the entire parade.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The parade continues down the boulevard beneath the Gateway arch one final time. Fireworks continue to burst overhead. The crowd celebrates as Edea's magical presence dominates the entire city. The scene slowly fades to black as the parade passes beyond the camera's view. The music swells and the FMV ends.
